---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Builds the browser extension and checks it in Chrome for Testing or Firefox: every page shows something, the worker runs, and each content script puts its frame on a page with a strict content security policy

Usage: leptoskit test extension [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>
          Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml

      --browser <BROWSER>
          Browser family to run

          Possible values:
          - chromium: Chrome for Testing
          - firefox:  Firefox through geckodriver
          
          [default: chromium]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
